   "hash": "71c51e17",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/1CH.7.1#p1-71c51e17",
     "text": "Who also is called Job, Ge 46:13.",
     "label": "a",
     "anchor": "Jashub",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "Ge 46:13",
       "ref": "GEN.46.13"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/1CH.7.2",
   "range": "1CH.7.2",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "ab23af16",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/1CH.7.2#p1-ab23af16",
     "text": "That is, their number was found to be this big when David counted the people, 2Sa 24:1.",
     "label": "b",
     "anchor": "whose number was in the days",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "2Sa 24:1",
       "ref": "2SA.24.1"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/1CH.7.3",
   "range": "1CH.7.3",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "7f33433f",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/1CH.7.3#p1-7f33433f",
     "text": "Meaning, the four sons and the father.",
     "label": "c",
     "anchor": "five"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/1CH.7.6",
   "range": "1CH.7.6",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "a5846ae2",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/1CH.7.6#p1-fe9ac064",
     "text": "Also called Ashbel, Ge 46:21, Nu 26:38.",
     "label": "d",
     "anchor": "Jediael",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "Ge 46:21, Nu 26:38",
       "ref": "GEN.46.21"
      },
      {
       "text": "Ge 46:21, Nu 26:38",
       "ref": "NUM.26.38"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "geneva/1CH.7.6#p2-7877e548",
     "text": "Who were the chief: or else there were seven in all as it appears in Ge 46:21.",
     "label": "e",
     "anchor": "three",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "Ge 46:21",
       "ref": "GEN.46.21"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/1CH.7.12",
   "range": "1CH.7.12",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "948ab804",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/1CH.7.12#p1-948ab804",
     "text": "Meaning that he was not the son of Benjamin, but of Dan Ge 46:23.",
     "label": "f",
     "anchor": "Aher",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "Ge 46:23",
       "ref": "GEN.46.23"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/1CH.7.13",
   "range": "1CH.7.13",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "367632d9",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/1CH.7.13#p1-367632d9",
     "text": "These came from Dan and Naphtali, who were the sons of Bilhah, Ge 46:23,24,25.",
     "label": "g",
     "anchor": "the sons of Bilhah",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "Ge 46:23,24,25",
       "ref": "GEN.46.23"
      },
      {
       "text": "Ge 46:23,24,25",
       "ref": "GEN.46.24"
      },
      {
       "text": "Ge 46:23,24,25",
       "ref": "GEN.46.25"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/1CH.7.18",
   "range": "1CH.7.18",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "119d08eb",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/1CH.7.18#p1-119d08eb",
     "text": "Meaning, the sister of Gilead.",
     "label": "h",
     "anchor": "his sister Hammoleketh bare Ishod"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/1CH.7.21",
   "range": "1CH.7.21",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "60b0940f",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/1CH.7.21#p1-60b0940f",
     "text": "Which was one of the five principal cities of the Philistines and who slew the Ephraimites.",
     "label": "i",
     "anchor": "Gath that were born in that"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/1CH.7.25",
   "range": "1CH.7.25",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "06319fa4",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/1CH.7.25#p1-06319fa4",
     "text": "That is, of Ephraim.",
     "label": "k",
     "anchor": "son"
    }
   ]
  }
 ]
}
